The script builds the binary, seeds four notes, then asserts set membership for `--tag shopping` and `--tag rust`, plus that no `--tag` preserves all-notes output, `--tag nosuch` returns nothing, and `--tag sh` (a substring of `#shopping`) returns nothing — confirming exact-match semantics.

